cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, cite the versioned software record and the accompanying preprint."
type: software
title: "SPPT / ASTRA v1.0.7: Stateful Edges and Operator-Aware Inference"
abstract: >-
  Versioned reference package for Solar-Planetary Phase-Partition Theory
  (SPPT) and its Astronomical State-Topology and Reservoir Analysis (ASTRA)
  inference layer. This not-peer-reviewed perspective adds a typed stateful-
  edge and operator-aware integration layer while retaining the v1.0.6
  conservation, thermodynamic, topology, and synthetic-baseline boundaries.
  External studies are calibration cases, not planetary validation; proposed
  methods remain explicitly qualified. Software is MIT licensed; manuscript,
  documentation, figures, data, and generated results are CC BY 4.0 under the
  file-level mapping in LICENSE_MAP.md.
authors:
  - name: "Jacko T."
